OL,3,GNorthern Ireland                       
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FContinuing   
OL,6,Fto stay mainly dry through the         
OL,7,Fevening, with some clear spells. Clear 
OL,8,Fspells overnight will lead to a cold   
OL,9,Fand frosty night, but turning cloudier 
OL,10,Flater with perhap s a few showers in   
OL,11,FDown. Light and variable winds.        
OL,13,CSaturday:FBright or sunny intervals    
OL,14,Fbut cloud tending to increase, CHance  
OL,15,Fof a few showers over eastern          
OL,16,Fcounties. Freshening southeasterly     
OL,17,Fbreeze.                                
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
