OL,3,GNorthern Ireland                       
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FCloudy  
OL,6,Fstart Sunday then brightening up. Rain 
OL,7,Farriving from the west on Monday and   
OL,8,Flingering on Tuesday though turning    
OL,9,Fbrighter later. Breezy, particularly   
OL,10,Falong coastal areas.                   
